WEBVTT

01:37.759 --> 01:40.630
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.430 --> 01:43.690
[Episode 31]

01:44.810 --> 01:47.509
[Liubo Temple]

02:21.840 --> 02:22.770
Where is Xin Mei?

02:23.710 --> 02:24.590
Cooking again?

02:25.630 --> 02:26.240
Yeah.

02:28.590 --> 02:30.190
Are there any words unclear?

02:30.560 --> 02:31.000
No.

02:31.430 --> 02:32.630
I just came to see you.

02:33.630 --> 02:34.960
Which volume is this?

02:35.590 --> 02:36.190
Volume 16.

02:36.560 --> 02:37.960
Sheng just delivered it.

02:44.190 --> 02:46.190
Why are the thicknesses different?

02:48.310 --> 02:49.640
These are still drying.

02:50.150 --> 02:51.710
Volume 11 over there is missing

02:51.710 --> 02:52.710
pages 3 and 7.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.400
And after page 20,

02:54.520 --> 02:55.920
they are all incomplete.

02:58.310 --> 02:59.430
Are you printing

03:00.150 --> 03:01.470
everything in duplicate?

03:01.470 --> 03:02.120
Yeah.

03:02.470 --> 03:03.530
To avoid mistakes.

03:03.750 --> 03:04.520
You alone

03:04.680 --> 03:06.190
have to print, apply ink,

03:06.400 --> 03:07.730
cut the paper, and sort.

03:07.840 --> 03:08.700
Can you manage?

03:08.870 --> 03:09.930
Do you need my help?

03:10.030 --> 03:10.840
No need.

03:11.120 --> 03:12.150
Don't be polite with me.

03:12.150 --> 03:14.000
I've finished carving my books for today.

03:14.000 --> 03:14.870
Time to eat.

03:20.610 --> 03:21.610
Time to eat again?

03:24.120 --> 03:24.800
Let's eat.

03:26.470 --> 03:27.280
Eat up.

03:37.079 --> 03:38.340
Why aren't you eating?

03:39.520 --> 03:40.720
Why is it all cabbage?

03:41.750 --> 03:42.350
Oh, right.

03:42.470 --> 03:43.760
I went down the mountain late yesterday.

03:43.760 --> 03:44.840
By the time I got to the market,

03:44.840 --> 03:45.910
there were no other vegetables left.

03:45.910 --> 03:46.720
Only cabbage.

03:47.560 --> 03:49.230
You don't like cabbage?

03:49.360 --> 03:50.470
No, I like it.

03:52.030 --> 03:53.960
Everything you make is delicious.

03:54.000 --> 03:54.530
Alright.

03:54.910 --> 03:55.750
Then eat more.

03:56.840 --> 03:57.900
Thank you, Senior.

03:59.190 --> 04:00.560
You must have been tired
from carving blocks.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.690
Eat more, everyone.

04:01.980 --> 04:02.790
Thank you.

04:12.240 --> 04:13.470
It still smells a bit burnt.

04:13.470 --> 04:14.270
What's wrong?

04:14.680 --> 04:16.339
I think it has a unique flavor.

04:19.190 --> 04:20.450
Midnight snack later.

04:21.839 --> 04:23.040
Be there or be square.

04:24.270 --> 04:24.870
By the way,

04:24.940 --> 04:26.800
which volume are you carving now?

04:27.430 --> 04:28.070
Volume 16.

04:29.190 --> 04:29.950
Is that

04:30.270 --> 04:31.800
the volume about Ma Sheng?

04:32.680 --> 04:33.810
When did you read it?

04:34.680 --> 04:35.190
When you were copying

04:35.190 --> 04:36.320
the old woodblocks.

04:39.360 --> 04:40.220
Who is Ma Sheng?

04:40.750 --> 04:41.680
What's his story about?

04:41.680 --> 04:43.450
He is a stable hand
who leads the princess's horse.

04:43.450 --> 04:44.720
Because the princess fell for him,

04:44.720 --> 04:45.570
overnight,

04:45.600 --> 04:47.260
he climbed the social ladder.

04:47.570 --> 04:48.130
“Why was

04:48.159 --> 04:49.600
a story like this included?

04:49.600 --> 04:50.600
Actually, it's a story about

04:50.600 --> 04:51.560
Ma Sheng protecting the princess,

04:51.560 --> 04:52.680
defending the realm,

04:52.680 --> 04:54.310
learning horsemanship and archery,

04:54.310 --> 04:56.120
and eventually went to North Xiang
to guard the border.

04:56.120 --> 04:57.920
Since then, they were far apart,

04:58.360 --> 05:00.600
yet they never stopped
thinking of each other.

05:00.600 --> 05:01.190
I often see

05:01.190 --> 05:02.240
this kind of story

05:02.270 --> 05:03.600
in cheap street novels.

05:03.600 --> 05:05.060
Later, that Ma Sheng died.

05:05.260 --> 05:06.510
The unsent letters he wrote

05:06.510 --> 05:08.370
to the princess were discovered.

05:08.530 --> 05:11.140
They were all timeless masterpieces
of poetry.

05:11.140 --> 05:11.790
And then,

05:11.830 --> 05:12.890
he was given a title

05:13.190 --> 05:14.390
called Lord Youyang.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.120
Why didn't you say so earlier?

05:17.120 --> 05:18.720
Beating around the bush so much—

05:18.720 --> 05:20.850
you could have just said Lord Youyang.

05:32.240 --> 05:33.510
Colluding with the immortal sect,

05:33.510 --> 05:35.170
extracting immortal perceptions,

05:35.170 --> 05:36.600
refining them into Yangyuan Pills,

05:36.600 --> 05:37.920
and selling them back to us.

05:37.920 --> 05:38.800
The Master of Qinghong Sect

05:38.800 --> 05:40.659
is really good at doing business.

05:52.390 --> 05:54.040
Are there any other clues?

05:55.120 --> 05:56.870
After the Master of Qinghong Sect died,

05:56.870 --> 05:59.090
the prefect of Phoenix City
took over the mess.

05:59.090 --> 06:00.240
We were in a hurry to bring Senior Bai

06:00.240 --> 06:01.310
back to the Central Plains,

06:01.310 --> 06:03.560
so we didn't notice
the mastermind behind it.

06:03.560 --> 06:05.220
I will notify the Sect Leaders

06:05.640 --> 06:07.510
to strictly order the immortal sects
to carry out internal inspections.

06:07.510 --> 06:08.840
We must find the traitor

06:08.920 --> 06:10.050
and purge the sects.

06:11.630 --> 06:13.950
-Thank you, Master Li.
-Thank you, Master Li.

06:13.950 --> 06:15.600
You've worked hard this time.

06:15.600 --> 06:16.510
North Xiang

06:17.000 --> 06:17.830
has never been bound

06:17.830 --> 06:19.480
by the rules of the Central Plains.

06:19.480 --> 06:20.920
As members of the younger generation,

06:20.920 --> 06:21.950
achieving such results

06:21.950 --> 06:23.560
on your first trip to North Xiang

06:23.560 --> 06:24.760
is truly remarkable.

06:25.240 --> 06:26.700
You flatter us, Master Li.

06:26.830 --> 06:27.560
Actually,

06:27.870 --> 06:29.470
if it weren't for Senior Bai,

06:30.430 --> 06:31.630
I wouldn't have been able to come back.

06:31.630 --> 06:33.290
Bai has worked hard this time.

06:33.600 --> 06:34.200
Master Li,

06:34.750 --> 06:35.480
is there really no chance

06:35.480 --> 06:36.940
for Senior Bai to recover?

06:40.800 --> 06:43.190
The disciples of Lingji Mountain
practice the Five-Element Formation.

06:43.190 --> 06:44.320
You should know that

06:44.480 --> 06:46.390
the human body is regulated
by the five elements,

06:46.390 --> 06:48.450
and each organ has its own attribute.

06:48.580 --> 06:50.640
Missing one cannot be supplemented.

06:51.000 --> 06:51.800
Besides,

06:52.130 --> 06:52.840
his Qihai,

06:52.870 --> 06:54.870
where the five meridians converge,

06:55.430 --> 06:56.680
has a large hole in it.

06:57.270 --> 06:59.730
And his immortal perception was extracted.

07:11.510 --> 07:12.160
Senior,

07:12.830 --> 07:15.360
I feel there's something fishy about this.

07:16.650 --> 07:18.430
Rumor has it
that the Master of Qinghong Sect

07:18.430 --> 07:20.070
is a superior cultivator
at the Void Stage.

07:20.070 --> 07:22.200
Qinghong Sect has countless masters.

07:22.600 --> 07:24.310
Bai is a Nascent Soul cultivator,

07:24.310 --> 07:26.110
yet he suffered such a huge loss.

07:30.390 --> 07:31.750
How did the two of you

07:32.150 --> 07:33.800
manage to escape?

07:34.870 --> 07:35.750
Qinghong Sect

07:36.120 --> 07:38.070
uses the pretext of hatred
toward the immortal sects

07:38.070 --> 07:39.480
to win people over to their side.

07:39.480 --> 07:41.120
Secretly,
they collude with the immortal sects,

07:41.120 --> 07:42.830
hunt immortal sect disciples,

07:42.830 --> 07:45.230
and make Yangyuan Pills for personal gain.

07:46.040 --> 07:47.720
We publicly exposed their

07:47.820 --> 07:49.020
dirty transactions,

07:49.040 --> 07:50.900
caused their followers to rebel,

07:51.000 --> 07:51.860
created chaos,

07:52.310 --> 07:53.630
and took advantage of the situation

07:53.630 --> 07:54.520
to escape.

07:56.720 --> 07:58.159
If I remember correctly,

07:59.750 --> 08:01.010
Young Sect Master Lin,

08:01.600 --> 08:04.680
you're still in
the Foundation Establishment Stage, right?

08:04.680 --> 08:05.430
So what?

08:08.830 --> 08:09.390
Senior,

08:10.270 --> 08:12.270
among the two Protectors,
the Four Dharma Kings,

08:12.270 --> 08:13.240
and the Eight Vajras

08:13.240 --> 08:14.240
of Qinghong Sect,

08:14.480 --> 08:17.870
even the weakest of them
is in the Foundation Establishment Stage.

08:17.870 --> 08:19.120
I don't understand.

08:19.800 --> 08:20.750
How exactly

08:21.120 --> 08:23.120
did you manage to take advantage

08:23.360 --> 08:24.760
of this messy situation?

08:25.190 --> 08:26.240
How could we know

08:26.800 --> 08:28.060
they were so powerful?

08:28.600 --> 08:29.920
You know so much about them.

08:29.920 --> 08:31.450
Have you been to North Xiang

08:31.760 --> 08:33.320
or fought with them?

08:35.840 --> 08:36.510
Randeng,

08:36.669 --> 08:38.840
you once fought with a Dharma King,

08:38.840 --> 08:39.549
right?

08:40.030 --> 08:41.080
How was he?

08:42.630 --> 08:43.120
Master,

08:43.630 --> 08:45.030
his realm was above mine.

08:47.360 --> 08:47.910
Senior,

08:48.720 --> 08:49.440
Randeng is

08:49.910 --> 08:51.600
a Nascent Soul cultivator.

08:52.840 --> 08:54.300
Since we are on this topic,

08:54.360 --> 08:55.560
there are some things

08:55.720 --> 08:56.870
I have to say.

08:57.630 --> 08:59.160
What else do you have to say?

08:59.600 --> 09:00.440
Sect Leader,

09:01.080 --> 09:02.320
I want to file a complaint.

09:02.320 --> 09:04.520
Who are you filing a complaint against?

09:05.550 --> 09:06.720
Sima Randeng.

09:07.240 --> 09:08.750
On our way back to the Central Plains,

09:08.750 --> 09:10.480
we had a fight with some people,

09:10.670 --> 09:11.670
and he used my junior brother

09:11.670 --> 09:12.670
as a human shield.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.680
When the pursuers caught up,

09:14.790 --> 09:16.650
he ran away without looking back.

09:16.870 --> 09:18.270
Abandoning fellow disciples

09:18.270 --> 09:19.670
and fleeing from battle—

09:19.720 --> 09:21.450
he is extremely cold-blooded.

09:23.790 --> 09:25.150
Is what he said true?

09:26.910 --> 09:27.390
Master,

09:27.670 --> 09:28.200
I didn't.

09:28.750 --> 09:30.670
Senior Uncle, if you don't trust me,

09:30.670 --> 09:31.930
you can ask Senior Bai.

09:32.870 --> 09:33.600
However,

09:34.290 --> 09:35.040
his repeated fleeing

09:35.040 --> 09:36.000
makes it hard

09:36.360 --> 09:37.720
not to suspect

09:38.550 --> 09:40.150
whether he did it on purpose.

09:40.360 --> 09:41.720
There is a mole among the immortal sects.

09:41.720 --> 09:42.320
Master Li,

09:42.630 --> 09:43.240
I suggest

09:43.870 --> 09:45.550
we start investigating
from our inner circle.

09:45.550 --> 09:47.010
Don't talk nonsense here.

09:48.120 --> 09:50.650
Please investigate this clearly,
Master Li.

09:54.270 --> 09:54.730
Master,

09:55.150 --> 09:56.960
I came back to deliver the message.

09:56.960 --> 09:58.510
I never had any intention of abandoning

09:58.510 --> 10:00.510
my fellow disciples to save myself.

10:00.540 --> 10:02.340
Senior Bai is still in recovery.

10:02.480 --> 10:03.670
Once he wakes up,

10:04.270 --> 10:06.130
we will know exactly what you did.

10:09.030 --> 10:10.890
The Twelve Immortal Sects
are united as one,

10:10.890 --> 10:12.670
which is why we have today's prosperity.

10:12.670 --> 10:14.400
When you first joined the sect,

10:14.480 --> 10:15.810
didn't anyone teach you

10:15.910 --> 10:17.510
to remember the rules of Dao?

10:18.240 --> 10:21.510
Disciples of the immortal sects
must not harm fellow disciples,

10:21.510 --> 10:23.110
must not leave others to die,

10:23.480 --> 10:25.940
and must not disregard
morality and ethics.

10:26.320 --> 10:27.450
Isn't being callous

10:27.480 --> 10:29.120
and standing by while others are in danger

10:29.120 --> 10:30.320
a form of evil?

10:31.160 --> 10:32.470
Even a newly admitted disciple

10:32.470 --> 10:33.600
wouldn't just leave

10:33.600 --> 10:35.270
a dying fellow disciple behind.

10:35.270 --> 10:35.750
What?

10:36.670 --> 10:38.670
Are you a baby in swaddling clothes?

10:38.910 --> 10:40.120
A scourge like you

10:40.320 --> 10:42.150
doesn't deserve
to be in Tianyuan Mountain,

10:42.150 --> 10:44.410
worshipping the same Dao Ancestor as us.

10:46.080 --> 10:46.810
Sect Master,

10:46.960 --> 10:47.420
Master,

10:47.700 --> 10:48.760
he is exaggerating

10:48.790 --> 10:50.520
and making false accusations.

10:52.720 --> 10:54.970
This is the touchstone
of Tianyin Mountain.

10:54.970 --> 10:56.670
It can test if you are lying.

10:57.670 --> 10:59.200
I dare to swear on it.

11:00.150 --> 11:01.010
What about you?

11:01.560 --> 11:02.480
Do you dare?

11:16.670 --> 11:17.630
Kneel!

11:24.460 --> 11:25.460
Our Tianyuan Sect

11:26.000 --> 11:28.260
is the head of the Twelve Immortal Sects.

11:29.240 --> 11:30.080
Senior Brother Sect Leader

11:30.080 --> 11:31.360
chose you

11:31.360 --> 11:32.760
among all the disciples.

11:32.850 --> 11:34.550
This trip to North Xiang
was for gaining experience.

11:34.550 --> 11:35.610
But what did you do?

11:36.150 --> 11:37.680
You escaped multiple times

11:38.550 --> 11:39.670
and ruined the trust

11:39.670 --> 11:41.200
between fellow disciples.

11:41.270 --> 11:44.600
Now you are still making excuses
in front of the Sect Leader.

11:44.600 --> 11:45.730
Admit your mistake!

11:49.080 --> 11:50.120
I was wrong.

11:54.390 --> 11:55.320
Senior Brother.

11:56.080 --> 11:57.390
For this trip to North Xiang,

11:57.390 --> 11:59.080
I was supposed to escort Bai.

11:59.790 --> 12:00.360
But

12:01.270 --> 12:03.130
I was injured in Chongling Valley

12:04.000 --> 12:04.930
and had no choice

12:05.180 --> 12:07.360
but to recommend Randeng

12:07.390 --> 12:08.360
to go in my place.

12:09.240 --> 12:09.790
Randeng is the disciple

12:09.790 --> 12:11.000
I personally raised.

12:11.790 --> 12:14.080
Although his personality is a bit flawed,

12:14.080 --> 12:14.480
he is

12:14.670 --> 12:16.000
absolutely loyal to you

12:16.030 --> 12:17.630
and Tianyuan Sect.

12:19.120 --> 12:19.720
This time,

12:25.200 --> 12:27.600
he must have just lost his head
for a moment.

12:34.790 --> 12:36.390
Even if I don't say anything,

12:37.760 --> 12:38.790
I'm afraid Junior Lin

12:38.790 --> 12:39.650
won't let it go.

12:41.000 --> 12:43.130
Go apologize to Young Sect Master Lin!

12:44.150 --> 12:44.670
Okay.

12:54.910 --> 12:56.170
I was wrong about this.

12:56.670 --> 12:59.000
Please forgive me, Young Sect Master Lin.

13:09.630 --> 13:10.910
If you're still dissatisfied,

13:10.910 --> 13:12.000
you can just

13:12.510 --> 13:13.960
give me a few punches here and now

13:13.960 --> 13:15.360
to vent your anger.

13:16.000 --> 13:16.870
Alright.

13:17.670 --> 13:19.150
You asked for it.

13:34.320 --> 13:36.980
Thank you for the lesson,
Young Sect Master Lin.

13:38.280 --> 13:42.250
[Liubo Temple]

14:01.270 --> 14:01.800
Let's go?

14:01.960 --> 14:02.510
Let's go!

14:15.630 --> 14:16.760
Where are you going?

14:20.120 --> 14:21.440
Lu, you are up so late at night.

14:21.440 --> 14:22.570
Where are you going?

14:23.030 --> 14:23.790
To buy ink.

14:24.670 --> 14:25.600
So late at night?

14:25.750 --> 14:26.440
To buy ink?

14:28.200 --> 14:28.790
Yeah.

14:34.430 --> 14:35.550
Let us go with you.

14:53.790 --> 14:54.440
Senior.

14:55.580 --> 14:57.150
Here is the sweet soup I made.

14:57.150 --> 14:57.630
Here.

14:58.880 --> 14:59.940
Thank you, Senior.

15:01.480 --> 15:03.680
It's so late. Why are you still reading?

15:05.030 --> 15:06.440
If I finish the proofreading at night,

15:06.440 --> 15:08.480
I can focus on carving during the day.

15:08.480 --> 15:10.120
Don't read so late in the future.

15:10.120 --> 15:11.270
It's bad for your eyes.

15:11.270 --> 15:12.200
There's no rush.

15:13.080 --> 15:14.120
We should rush.

15:14.870 --> 15:16.200
Once the book is carved,

15:16.480 --> 15:17.880
we can return to the Sect,

15:18.030 --> 15:18.480
right?

15:19.080 --> 15:20.010
You miss Master?

15:21.120 --> 15:21.750
No.

15:36.550 --> 15:37.080
Senior,

15:37.630 --> 15:39.090
they went out to eat again.

15:39.600 --> 15:40.600
If they come back late,

15:40.600 --> 15:42.000
they'll wake up late tomorrow,

15:42.000 --> 15:43.800
and the work will never get done.

15:43.840 --> 15:44.840
So you just want to help everyone

15:44.840 --> 15:45.770
finish the work?

15:46.080 --> 15:47.340
Our Sheng has grown up.

15:47.670 --> 15:48.550
No.

15:48.870 --> 15:50.130
It's that Lu Qianqiao.

15:50.270 --> 15:52.000
He says your food is delicious,

15:52.150 --> 15:54.280
but he never skips a late-night snack.

16:00.480 --> 16:01.880
Where did this come from?

16:06.150 --> 16:07.080
Baked buns!

16:07.200 --> 16:09.440
Crispy and tasty baked buns!

16:09.480 --> 16:10.150
Take a look, sir.

16:10.150 --> 16:11.750
Honey pastries!

16:11.790 --> 16:12.750
Only three Wen!

16:12.840 --> 16:14.180
Are you really here to buy ink?

16:14.180 --> 16:14.670
Come and take a look.

16:14.670 --> 16:15.960
This street is full of food.

16:15.960 --> 16:17.490
Look at the honey pastries.

16:18.320 --> 16:19.550
Can you stop walking?

16:19.960 --> 16:21.750
You've had several bowls of rice tonight,

16:21.750 --> 16:23.680
but we haven't eaten anything yet.

16:23.840 --> 16:24.300
Well...

16:24.490 --> 16:25.360
Smelling all these

16:25.360 --> 16:26.510
and walking around in circles,

16:26.510 --> 16:27.640
isn't this torture?

16:29.280 --> 16:30.280
This is the place.

16:39.360 --> 16:40.000
This shop

16:40.320 --> 16:42.520
is a century-old brand in Phoenix City,

16:42.720 --> 16:44.630
and the sheep blood tofu stew
is their signature dish.

16:44.630 --> 16:45.690
Fresh sheep blood,

16:45.750 --> 16:47.080
boiled with bone broth—

16:47.080 --> 16:48.340
tender and delicious.

16:52.530 --> 16:53.190
Weren't you

16:53.200 --> 16:54.360
unable to taste anything before?

16:54.360 --> 16:55.620
How do you know so much?

16:56.120 --> 16:57.120
Lin Muhan said it.

16:59.200 --> 17:01.060
The sheep blood tofu stew is here!

17:05.200 --> 17:05.920
Here.

17:06.270 --> 17:06.869
Thank you.

17:08.349 --> 17:09.069
Enjoy.

17:22.720 --> 17:24.180
You're so particular now?

17:26.200 --> 17:28.930
This makes me look like
I'm not particular at all.

17:33.480 --> 17:34.140
Delicious!

17:43.550 --> 17:45.550
You haven't had much good food before.

17:45.550 --> 17:47.030
You just recovered your Taste,

17:47.030 --> 17:48.830
and then you ate the food Xin Mei cooked.

17:48.830 --> 17:50.030
It's understandable

17:50.110 --> 17:51.710
you can't tell good from bad.

17:53.200 --> 17:54.680
Now that you've had something good,

17:54.680 --> 17:55.510
objectively speaking,

17:55.510 --> 17:57.750
what do you think
of Xin Mei's cabbage feast?

17:57.750 --> 17:59.210
I think it was pretty good.

18:02.720 --> 18:03.720
What do you think?

18:05.070 --> 18:06.600
That would be so offensive.

18:12.480 --> 18:13.480
But to be honest,

18:14.110 --> 18:15.070
it really

18:15.750 --> 18:16.640
tasted awful.

18:30.360 --> 18:31.560
He fell down together

18:31.590 --> 18:33.190
with Xia Xuanzi at that time.

18:34.030 --> 18:35.400
I did try to grab him

18:36.000 --> 18:36.860
and pull him up.

18:38.200 --> 18:39.030
But...

18:40.790 --> 18:41.440
but the moment I saw

18:41.440 --> 18:42.880
Xia Xuanzi,

18:43.830 --> 18:46.160
I was so terrified
that I lost my composure

18:46.350 --> 18:47.550
and let go of his hand.

18:49.550 --> 18:50.350
Jin Lun...

18:51.270 --> 18:52.440
Jin Lun!

19:13.320 --> 19:14.680
I thought he and Xia Xuanzi

19:14.680 --> 19:16.540
were both buried under the cliff.

19:17.120 --> 19:18.440
But later, while escorting Tang You

19:18.440 --> 19:20.300
and An back to the Central Plains,

19:20.830 --> 19:21.690
I met him again.

19:22.790 --> 19:23.790
He's still alive?

19:25.750 --> 19:26.720
He lost an arm.

19:29.270 --> 19:31.880
There are countless poisonous insects
under Wushui Cliff.

19:31.880 --> 19:33.070
If it were an ordinary cultivator,

19:33.070 --> 19:34.930
they would definitely have died.

19:34.960 --> 19:36.310
But he had the Master
of Tianyin Mountain's

19:36.310 --> 19:37.770
bracelet protecting him,

19:37.830 --> 19:38.880
so he survived.

19:39.350 --> 19:40.000
And then?

19:43.070 --> 19:43.750
Why?

19:44.400 --> 19:45.920
Why did you do that to me?

19:46.240 --> 19:47.270
Didn't you say

19:47.880 --> 19:49.640
the core of fate never changes?

19:50.150 --> 19:50.720
Why

19:51.830 --> 19:54.090
didn't you foresee what I've done to you?

19:56.310 --> 19:58.480
I am the daughter of Xia Xuanzi.

19:59.400 --> 20:01.240
I am heartless by nature.

20:02.550 --> 20:04.080
The earlier you realize it,

20:04.440 --> 20:05.970
the better it'll be for you.

20:06.310 --> 20:07.640
If you don't want to die,

20:08.310 --> 20:09.640
just stop following me.

20:16.680 --> 20:18.880
Senior, you must be disappointed in me.

20:21.310 --> 20:21.920
Sheng,

20:22.750 --> 20:23.880
do you like Jin Lun?

20:25.270 --> 20:26.160
Like him?

20:27.000 --> 20:27.590
Right.

20:28.550 --> 20:30.310
He's someone who is willing to

20:30.310 --> 20:31.510
risk his life for you,

20:31.790 --> 20:33.070
and even after you abandoned him,

20:33.070 --> 20:34.530
he still didn't blame you.

20:35.190 --> 20:36.270
You don't like him?

20:42.480 --> 20:43.270
Then when you reunited

20:43.270 --> 20:44.270
at Crescent Lake,

20:45.160 --> 20:46.360
why did you let him go?

20:47.310 --> 20:49.270
After you found out
that Xia Xuanzi wasn't dead

20:49.270 --> 20:51.400
and decided to leave the desert alone,

20:51.440 --> 20:53.880
heading into an uncertain
and dangerous future—

20:53.880 --> 20:55.740
Jin Lun has profound cultivation

20:56.070 --> 20:57.680
and possesses a divine artifact,

20:57.680 --> 21:00.010
so he could clearly
have been a great help.

21:00.440 --> 21:01.840
Why did you let him leave?

21:05.880 --> 21:07.960
Were you afraid
that if he kept following you,

21:07.960 --> 21:09.290
he would get hurt again?

21:14.960 --> 21:15.640
Senior,

21:16.640 --> 21:17.070
just take it as

21:17.070 --> 21:18.670
being by your side for so long

21:18.680 --> 21:20.210
made my conscience kick in.

21:20.960 --> 21:22.070
Don't you always say

21:22.070 --> 21:23.930
that I actually have a good heart?

21:27.160 --> 21:28.160
But Sheng, look.

21:28.720 --> 21:29.640
Besides me,

21:30.070 --> 21:31.270
there are many others

21:31.310 --> 21:32.960
willing to protect you like this,

21:32.960 --> 21:34.110
even at the cost of their lives.

21:34.110 --> 21:34.720
Senior.

21:36.640 --> 21:37.370
In this life,

21:37.920 --> 21:39.720
I only want to stay in Xin Xie Manor.

21:39.720 --> 21:41.350
I just want to follow you.

21:45.640 --> 21:46.310
Senior,

21:46.960 --> 21:48.290
do you like Lu Qianqiao?

21:52.590 --> 21:54.050
If you like him, it's okay.

21:57.270 --> 21:57.830
You...

21:58.550 --> 22:00.160
You've changed your opinion of him?

22:00.160 --> 22:01.030
I guess so.

22:01.680 --> 22:03.010
I didn't like him before

22:03.160 --> 22:05.020
because his power was too strong.

22:05.070 --> 22:07.030
I was afraid
you would be at a disadvantage.

22:07.030 --> 22:08.000
Right now, he is only a

22:08.000 --> 22:08.920
Foundation Establishment cultivator.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.480
And he will continue to fall.

22:10.480 --> 22:11.940
He's no match for me at all.

22:12.240 --> 22:13.360
If he fails you,

22:13.830 --> 22:15.440
I'll kill him with one strike.

22:15.440 --> 22:16.640
Don't talk nonsense.

22:24.680 --> 22:26.160
This is the real delicacy.

22:26.270 --> 22:26.880
Excuse me!

22:27.440 --> 22:28.270
Coming!

22:29.310 --> 22:30.400
You can still eat?

22:30.920 --> 22:32.430
Pack one sheep blood tofu stew.

22:32.430 --> 22:33.430
I'll take it to go.

22:33.880 --> 22:36.810
Are you only getting one portion
for 2 people at home?

22:37.110 --> 22:38.350
Well then... 2 portions.

22:38.350 --> 22:38.830
Got it!

22:52.270 --> 22:53.600
What are you looking at?

22:56.590 --> 22:58.050
That day at Qinghong Sect,

22:58.480 --> 23:00.140
you guys heard it, didn't you?

23:01.200 --> 23:01.960
Heard what?

23:03.480 --> 23:04.610
That I am a War Demon.

23:06.790 --> 23:08.450
Is being a War Demon a big deal?

23:09.510 --> 23:10.770
Are you going to eat me?

23:12.550 --> 23:13.590
I knew it long ago.

23:28.290 --> 23:34.330
[Tianyuan Sect]

23:32.720 --> 23:33.310
Junior.

23:35.720 --> 23:36.270
Thank you

23:36.880 --> 23:37.790
for not telling

23:37.790 --> 23:38.830
Lu Qianqiao's secret.

23:38.830 --> 23:40.430
When I first joined the sect,

23:40.560 --> 23:41.720
the first thing Master taught me

23:41.720 --> 23:43.160
was to always remember our roots

23:43.160 --> 23:44.090
and be grateful.

23:44.790 --> 23:45.400
Neither of us

23:45.400 --> 23:46.260
is ungrateful.

23:46.680 --> 23:47.440
He saved us.

23:48.200 --> 23:50.640
Naturally,
I wouldn't bite the hand that feeds me.

23:50.640 --> 23:51.200
Senior.

23:52.560 --> 23:53.620
You should go back.

23:54.790 --> 23:55.720
What do you mean?

23:56.440 --> 23:57.700
You're not going back?

24:04.510 --> 24:06.240
Bai Zongying's immortal perception
was dug out.

24:06.240 --> 24:07.790
He's just an ordinary person now.

24:07.790 --> 24:08.790
In Tianyuan Sect,

24:09.270 --> 24:10.870
things won't go well for him.

24:11.590 --> 24:12.990
Exactly because of this,

24:13.070 --> 24:13.960
I must stay.

24:15.000 --> 24:15.590
Senior,

24:16.510 --> 24:17.770
I can't just walk away.

24:18.270 --> 24:19.350
Because my life

24:20.920 --> 24:22.250
was saved by Senior Bai.

24:27.070 --> 24:28.130
-Senior!
-Senior!

24:28.920 --> 24:29.790
This formation is

24:29.790 --> 24:30.510
too weird.

24:30.880 --> 24:31.920
We are no match for it.

24:31.920 --> 24:33.110
You guys, leave here now.

24:33.110 --> 24:34.960
Go back to Lingji Mountain
and ask Master for help.

24:34.960 --> 24:36.160
That's easy for you to say, Senior.

24:36.160 --> 24:37.270
We're trapped in the barrier.

24:37.270 --> 24:38.200
How can we get out?

24:38.200 --> 24:38.730
Besides,

24:38.960 --> 24:40.640
your eyes were injured by the formation.

24:40.640 --> 24:41.880
You can't see anything.

24:41.880 --> 24:43.210
And you can't help much.

24:43.440 --> 24:45.170
I will break the barrier later.

24:45.250 --> 24:46.680
You guys, hurry and escape.

24:46.680 --> 24:47.500
No, Senior!

24:47.550 --> 24:48.810
You'll die if you stay.

24:48.880 --> 24:49.610
Enough talk.

24:49.680 --> 24:51.080
Tell me where the exit is.

24:53.030 --> 24:55.290
The exit is right behind you to the right.

24:58.830 --> 24:59.310
Go!

25:00.070 --> 25:00.600
Let's go!

25:01.200 --> 25:01.750
Senior!

25:01.960 --> 25:02.830
Just go!

25:33.750 --> 25:34.310
Who is it?

25:34.790 --> 25:35.450
Let go of me!

25:35.640 --> 25:36.370
Hold on to me.

25:36.720 --> 25:37.780
I'll take you away.

26:24.880 --> 26:25.740
Is anyone here?

26:27.110 --> 26:28.000
Is anyone here?

26:51.880 --> 26:52.720
Who's there?

26:54.440 --> 26:56.170
Your eye injury hasn't healed.

26:57.160 --> 26:58.960
You can't be exposed to light yet.

26:58.960 --> 27:00.220
Don't come any closer.

27:02.030 --> 27:02.920
Who are you?

27:03.310 --> 27:04.170
Tianyuan Sect,

27:04.670 --> 27:05.480
Bai Zongying.

27:14.000 --> 27:15.960
Tianyuan Sect
cannot compare to Lingji Mountain.

27:15.960 --> 27:17.400
Even with Master Li's care,

27:17.400 --> 27:18.860
you are still an outsider.

27:18.920 --> 27:20.440
You won't be able to help much.

27:20.440 --> 27:21.160
I know.

27:23.960 --> 27:25.720
If you ever face any difficulties,

27:25.720 --> 27:27.310
remember to send me a message.

27:27.310 --> 27:28.910
People from Lingji Mountain

27:29.070 --> 27:30.600
won't be bullied anywhere.

27:32.830 --> 27:33.430
Take care.

28:13.200 --> 28:14.800
Do you have something to say?

28:16.440 --> 28:16.880
Yes.

28:17.550 --> 28:18.110
Go ahead.

28:19.350 --> 28:20.750
This time in North Xiang,

28:20.790 --> 28:22.590
I fought against Qinghong Sect.

28:23.020 --> 28:23.640
With the strength of

28:23.640 --> 28:24.960
Lin Muhan and Jiang Ji,

28:25.170 --> 28:26.110
they couldn't possibly break into

28:26.110 --> 28:27.590
Qinghong Sect's headquarters,

28:27.590 --> 28:29.190
let alone get out unscathed.

28:29.480 --> 28:30.140
Therefore,

28:30.240 --> 28:31.030
they must have hid

28:31.030 --> 28:32.160
something from you.

28:34.400 --> 28:36.260
Didn't you also leave Bai behind,

28:36.590 --> 28:38.440
return to the Central Plains alone,

28:38.440 --> 28:39.960
and not say a word

28:40.200 --> 28:41.400
about what happened?

28:41.830 --> 28:42.550
I was wrong.

28:43.030 --> 28:44.760
Please punish me, Sect Master.

28:44.790 --> 28:46.270
Being selfish in times of danger

28:46.270 --> 28:47.440
is human nature.

28:49.030 --> 28:50.640
Your cultivation is shallow.

28:50.640 --> 28:51.640
For your own life,

28:52.030 --> 28:53.440
you made a forced choice.

28:54.000 --> 28:55.400
I don't want to blame you.

28:55.680 --> 28:57.400
Putting yourself in their shoes,

28:57.400 --> 28:58.860
you shouldn't be too harsh

28:59.440 --> 29:01.170
on disciples from other sects.

29:01.720 --> 29:03.030
Thank you for teaching me.

29:03.030 --> 29:03.830
However,

29:04.200 --> 29:06.130
you just reminded me of something.

29:07.270 --> 29:08.930
What do you mean, Sect Leader?

29:09.200 --> 29:10.350
You mentioned

29:10.720 --> 29:12.920
that female disciple from Xin Xie Manor

29:13.310 --> 29:14.000
and the man beside her

29:14.000 --> 29:15.600
who has been protecting her.

29:15.680 --> 29:17.210
What is their cultivation?

29:17.300 --> 29:19.560
They are both Nascent Soul cultivators.

29:22.640 --> 29:23.370
Sect Leader,

29:23.720 --> 29:25.250
Elder Mo Guan has returned.

30:48.110 --> 30:48.710
Thank you.

30:49.880 --> 30:51.510
It's a long journey from North Xiang

30:51.510 --> 30:52.770
to the Central Plains.

30:52.830 --> 30:54.590
Please take care, Senior Bai.

30:55.790 --> 30:56.920
Aren't you leaving?

30:57.590 --> 30:59.450
I still have matters to attend to.

31:05.720 --> 31:07.050
Look at that dragonfly.

31:07.240 --> 31:08.040
How romantic.

31:10.030 --> 31:11.750
Its tail was broken by a spider web,

31:11.750 --> 31:12.610
and it's dying.

31:13.110 --> 31:14.110
Is this romantic?

31:15.030 --> 31:15.640
Yes.

31:17.480 --> 31:18.070
Why?

31:18.350 --> 31:20.010
Because I've experienced it.

31:20.240 --> 31:21.170
Tell me about it.

31:22.110 --> 31:23.920
It was when my realm dropped.

31:24.400 --> 31:26.400
Dropped from the Golden Core Stage?

31:26.960 --> 31:28.090
I've experienced it

31:28.110 --> 31:29.070
3 times in total.

31:29.790 --> 31:30.960
But at that moment,

31:31.680 --> 31:32.790
I felt freedom.

31:45.400 --> 31:46.160
Senior Bai.

31:47.200 --> 31:48.460
If your heart is bound,

31:48.680 --> 31:50.200
no matter how high your realm is

31:50.200 --> 31:51.680
or how strong your magic power is,

31:51.680 --> 31:52.740
you won't be happy.

31:53.440 --> 31:54.640
If your heart is free,

31:55.110 --> 31:56.640
you are free in everything,

31:57.070 --> 31:58.470
even if your realm drops,

31:59.240 --> 32:01.440
even if you have no immortal perception,

32:01.440 --> 32:03.170
or even if you are just a mortal.

32:33.750 --> 32:34.440
Senior Bai.

32:36.480 --> 32:37.680
What brings you here?

32:38.070 --> 32:39.400
I was worried about you.

32:39.960 --> 32:40.550
I'm fine.

32:41.000 --> 32:42.060
I feel much better.

32:44.440 --> 32:45.500
You call this fine?

32:46.400 --> 32:47.530
Let me help you back.

32:48.070 --> 32:48.720
Okay.

33:05.410 --> 33:07.880
[Wei County]

33:21.240 --> 33:22.300
Young Sect Master,

33:22.680 --> 33:23.610
are you alright?

33:27.470 --> 33:27.940
Grandpa.

33:27.940 --> 33:28.510
Young Sect Master?

33:28.510 --> 33:29.040
Grandpa.

33:29.590 --> 33:31.320
You forgot the osmanthus cake.

33:32.070 --> 33:32.750
Grandpa,

33:33.120 --> 33:34.830
you said this shop's osmanthus cake

33:34.830 --> 33:35.510
is the best.

33:37.030 --> 33:38.350
You barely have any teeth left.

33:38.350 --> 33:40.810
If you eat more sweets,
you'll lose them all.

33:41.310 --> 33:41.880
But...

33:42.210 --> 33:43.410
Grandpa said my teeth

33:43.440 --> 33:44.640
will grow back.

33:45.160 --> 33:46.920
Grandpa would never lie to me.

33:47.480 --> 33:48.200
Jiujiu,

33:48.400 --> 33:49.830
I won't lie to you.

33:50.310 --> 33:51.910
When your new teeth grow out,

33:52.270 --> 33:53.440
you can eat sweet cakes again.

33:53.440 --> 33:54.200
Sound good?

33:54.460 --> 33:54.960
Okay.

33:55.830 --> 33:56.360
Let's go.

33:57.510 --> 33:58.750
Be careful.

33:59.440 --> 34:00.110
Okay.

34:01.400 --> 34:02.160
Let's go.

34:02.450 --> 34:03.180
Did you hear?

34:03.240 --> 34:04.510
That guy outside the city hasn't left yet.

34:04.510 --> 34:05.370
He hasn't left?

34:05.720 --> 34:07.160
Going without food and water
for so many days,

34:07.160 --> 34:08.420
he won't last, will he?

34:08.880 --> 34:10.340
I heard he's a cultivator.

34:11.159 --> 34:12.710
They say cultivators
can abstain from food.

34:12.710 --> 34:13.610
Is it true?

34:14.000 --> 34:14.760
Who knows?

34:14.920 --> 34:15.800
Come on, let's drink.

34:15.800 --> 34:16.530
Let's drink.

34:47.710 --> 34:48.710
Wait for me here.

34:49.429 --> 34:50.880
You don't need to follow me in.

34:50.880 --> 34:51.540
-Yes.
-Yes.

34:57.070 --> 34:57.630
Jin Lun?

34:58.630 --> 34:59.610
Why are you here?

35:06.820 --> 35:08.080
Your mind is restless,

35:08.280 --> 35:09.960
and your Dao heart is in turmoil.

35:09.960 --> 35:12.070
How can you comprehend the Dao
and improve?

35:12.070 --> 35:12.730
Never mind.

35:13.070 --> 35:14.470
Since we know each other,

35:14.480 --> 35:15.760
I will help you out.

35:51.880 --> 35:54.550
The turbid qi
is chaotic and uncontrollable.

35:54.880 --> 35:57.020
If you accidentally inhale
even a trace of it,

35:57.020 --> 35:58.710
it will erode your immortal perception.

35:58.710 --> 35:59.670
Yin or Yang alone

35:59.920 --> 36:00.800
cannot grow.

36:01.230 --> 36:03.320
All things share the same origin.

36:03.760 --> 36:06.230
Heaven and earth
are fundamentally connected.

36:06.230 --> 36:08.030
Take clear qi as the foundation.

36:08.110 --> 36:10.440
The state of mind has no beginning or end.

36:11.230 --> 36:13.230
Clouds roll in and out.

36:13.440 --> 36:15.280
Winds come and go into the void.

36:15.480 --> 36:17.230
Hold fast to your true essence.

36:17.710 --> 36:20.400
Do not let the impure qi become a flood.

36:27.590 --> 36:28.480
The turbid qi?

36:36.960 --> 36:39.220
You're not in any serious danger for now.

36:39.960 --> 36:41.360
But your cultivation...

36:41.840 --> 36:43.150
I am afraid that from now on,

36:43.150 --> 36:44.510
it can't progress any further.

36:44.510 --> 36:45.150
I know.

36:45.670 --> 36:46.760
Master told me.

36:48.710 --> 36:50.110
Then why did you still...

36:50.360 --> 36:52.060
The situation was critical then.

36:52.060 --> 36:53.330
I had no other choice.

36:55.510 --> 36:56.220
Besides,

36:56.510 --> 36:58.400
I have already reached
the Nascent Soul realm,

36:58.400 --> 37:00.530
so I have nothing more to be greedy for.

37:01.590 --> 37:02.190
But you...

37:03.320 --> 37:05.440
You are about to become
an ordinary person.

37:05.440 --> 37:07.640
Your realm will be much lower than mine.

37:09.190 --> 37:09.880
Yes.

37:10.550 --> 37:12.210
You are much stronger than me.

37:12.230 --> 37:13.690
But there is one technique

37:13.880 --> 37:14.810
that only I know,

37:15.150 --> 37:15.950
and you don't.

37:16.280 --> 37:16.880
What is it?

37:18.150 --> 37:19.080
Close your eyes.

37:52.760 --> 37:53.710
Xin Mei?

37:54.920 --> 37:55.510
Thank you

37:55.940 --> 37:57.030
for agreeing to marry me.

37:57.030 --> 37:58.290
I should thank you too.

38:00.840 --> 38:01.840
I remember now.

38:03.920 --> 38:04.880
I remember now.

38:11.190 --> 38:11.920
But...

38:12.360 --> 38:13.840
didn't you tell me before

38:14.590 --> 38:16.850
that only Chu Ying knows this technique?

38:18.110 --> 38:19.970
Before, he was the only one who knew it.

38:19.970 --> 38:20.630
But after I remembered

38:20.630 --> 38:21.630
some of the past,

38:22.190 --> 38:23.000
I knew it too.

38:24.800 --> 38:25.800
I told you before.

38:26.400 --> 38:27.590
Chu Ying is a spirit,

38:27.920 --> 38:28.580
not a human.

38:29.440 --> 38:30.070
He relies on

38:30.070 --> 38:31.110
my power to exist.

38:31.550 --> 38:32.950
The stronger my power is,

38:33.250 --> 38:34.250
the longer he can

38:34.280 --> 38:35.680
maintain his human form.

38:35.800 --> 38:36.880
The weaker my power is,

38:36.880 --> 38:37.960
the weaker he becomes.

38:37.960 --> 38:38.960
And his abilities

38:39.440 --> 38:41.040
are exactly the same as mine.

38:41.440 --> 38:42.190
Well...

38:43.110 --> 38:43.920
Back then,

38:44.150 --> 38:45.670
after I left Liubo Temple,

38:45.960 --> 38:47.670
I wandered through the mortal world alone.

38:47.670 --> 38:48.600
I was too lonely,

38:48.880 --> 38:50.400
so I used my powers

38:50.590 --> 38:52.320
to help a spirit tree cultivate.

38:52.320 --> 38:53.840
That is the origin of Chu Ying.

38:53.840 --> 38:54.640
A spirit tree?

38:55.030 --> 38:57.070
So Chu Ying is a piece of wood?

38:58.320 --> 38:58.800
Yes.

38:59.710 --> 39:01.510
He doesn't look like wood at all.

39:01.960 --> 39:03.280
He's free-spirited

39:03.480 --> 39:05.610
and perfectly complements my nature.

39:15.580 --> 39:16.670
It's so late.

39:17.110 --> 39:18.710
Why aren't you sleeping yet?

39:21.150 --> 39:23.190
I ate too much and can't sleep.

39:24.590 --> 39:26.150
You just regained your Taste,

39:26.150 --> 39:28.210
so everything must taste delicious.

39:28.360 --> 39:30.420
But you still shouldn't eat too much.

39:30.480 --> 39:31.150
Let me see.

39:36.230 --> 39:38.160
You seem to have put on some weight.

39:38.550 --> 39:40.230
You shouldn't eat too many meals a day.

39:40.230 --> 39:42.290
Otherwise, it's bad for your health.

39:42.670 --> 39:43.280
Okay.

39:43.730 --> 39:44.400
I see.

39:45.880 --> 39:47.480
We haven't even reached
the Central Plains yet.

39:47.480 --> 39:48.960
There's more delicious food there.

39:48.960 --> 39:50.290
You'll be dazzled then,

39:50.480 --> 39:52.280
and won't be able to control yourself.

39:52.280 --> 39:54.080
The woodblocks are almost done.

39:54.360 --> 39:55.220
In half a month,

39:55.480 --> 39:57.480
we can return to the Central Plains.

39:58.960 --> 39:59.710
So by then,

39:59.960 --> 40:01.090
what are your plans?

40:03.340 --> 40:04.760
I'll hand over
the copied Unparalleled Secret Magic

40:04.760 --> 40:05.890
to Wushuang Society

40:06.480 --> 40:08.190
and go to Chongling Valley
to have my heart transformed.

40:08.190 --> 40:08.920
Then...

40:09.320 --> 40:10.550
I'll just travel around.

40:10.550 --> 40:11.410
Travel around?

40:11.920 --> 40:13.180
Where do you want to go?

40:13.190 --> 40:14.580
Before Su left,

40:14.880 --> 40:16.110
he left me a journal.

40:16.770 --> 40:18.710
It records local foods everywhere.

40:18.710 --> 40:20.760
I want to travel and taste them.

40:27.800 --> 40:29.000
Do you want to join me?

40:33.840 --> 40:34.510
But...

40:35.320 --> 40:36.780
I've been away from my sect

40:37.110 --> 40:38.370
for too long this time.

40:38.440 --> 40:39.920
If I don't go back soon,

40:40.190 --> 40:41.650
my master will be unhappy.

40:43.230 --> 40:44.760
Is there any delicious food

40:45.000 --> 40:45.960
near your sect?

40:46.710 --> 40:47.640
There's plenty.

40:48.160 --> 40:49.040
Near my sect,

40:49.070 --> 40:50.330
there's a food street.

40:50.610 --> 40:52.210
There are Yangchun noodles,

40:52.230 --> 40:52.890
corn cakes,

40:53.190 --> 40:54.190
boiled meatballs,

40:54.190 --> 40:56.520
and Lion's Head meatballs. You know them?

41:09.550 --> 41:10.550
And there's more.

41:12.400 --> 41:13.530
Why are you smiling?

41:14.510 --> 41:15.190
Nothing.

41:16.440 --> 41:17.400
I just like listening to you talk.
